10\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"6,4\"/></svg><p>A spring (k = 400 N/m) is compressed by 12 cm and releases a 0.080 kg ball. Assuming all elastic PE converts to kinetic energy, calculate the ball's speed in m/s.</p>",
